    "Evdeki cihazlara g\u00f6re haz\u0131r komutlar, h\u0131zl\u0131 otomasyonlar ve ak\u0131ll\u0131 uygulama \u00f6nerileri ver.": "Geef kant-en-klare opdrachten, snelle automatiseringen en slimme app-suggesties op basis van de apparaten in huis.", // EN: Give ready commands, quick automations and smart app suggestions based on the devices at home.
    "Evdeki klima ve termostatlar\u0131 tek panelde y\u00f6neten bir iklim konfor uygulamas\u0131 olu\u015ftur. S\u0131cakl\u0131k ayar\u0131, h\u0131zl\u0131 mod se\u00e7enekleri, eko modu ve oda bazl\u0131 kontrol aksiyonlar\u0131 olsun.": "Maak een klimaatcomfort-app die de airco's en thermostaten in uw huis vanuit \u00e9\u00e9n paneel beheert.Inclusief temperatuurregeling, snelle modi, eco-modus en kamergebaseerde acties.", // EN: Create a climate comfort app that manages the ACs and thermostats in your home from one panel. Include temperature control, quick modes, eco mode and room-based actions.
    "Evimdeki cihazlar\u0131n durumu nedir?": "Wat is de status van mijn apparaten?", // EN: What is the status of my devices?
