    "Ekledi\u011fin kameralar\u0131n durumunu ve gizlilik ayar\u0131n\u0131 tek ekranda g\u00f6r.": "Bekijk de status en privacy-instelling van uw camera's op \u00e9\u00e9n scherm.", // EN: See the status and privacy setting of your cameras on one screen.
